        "answer": {
          "short": "$n=3$ or $7$.",
          "worked": "By the symmetry property, $${}^{10}C_3={}^{10}C_{10-3}={}^{10}C_7.$$ Hence $n=3$ or $7$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 18
      },
